+#### [PaddleOCR](https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR)
+> **Description:** PaddleOCR positions itself as a production-ready OCR and document AI engine that turns PDFs and images into AI-friendly structured data such as Markdown and JSON. For accountants, that matters because the repo covers invoice capture, bank statement parsing, multilingual receipts, and other document-heavy back-office flows without forcing a hosted vendor dependency. Its README emphasizes broad language support, end-to-end document understanding, and integration into downstream AI pipelines. GitHub metadata shows the project is heavily maintained and widely adopted. Last commit date: Apr 1, 2026. Stars count: 74.5k. Primary language: Python. License type: Apache-2.0.
