+#### [Prophet](https://github.com/facebook/prophet)
+> **Description:** Prophet is one of the best-known open-source forecasting libraries and is still practical for accounting and FP&A teams that need clear, reliable baseline forecasts. The README describes an additive model that handles seasonality, holidays, missing data, and trend shifts well, which maps directly to revenue forecasting, expense patterns, payroll cycles, and cash planning. It is not the newest deep-learning stack, but it remains a strong choice when explainability and fast iteration matter more than leaderboard-chasing. GitHub metadata shows long-term adoption and continued maintenance. Last commit date: Mar 24, 2026. Stars count: 20.1k. Primary language: Python. License type: MIT.
